{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Elusives are <strong>tiny creatures</strong> that inhabit our homes, hiding from us and borrowing whatever they need. Humans are so big and clumsy that they do not perceive the <strong>world full of adventure and resources</strong> that extends before their feet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/9e738f7df4ca4b9f6c371ae630498794.avif?t=1759326153\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elusive raiders venture into homes to find precious resources to <strong>help the community thrive</strong>, but they\u2019re also  the most careful not to be captured by animals and other <i>huge</i> creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll <strong>explore every corner</strong> of an old haunted house, uncovering new pathways and tunnels within the walls that will lead you to hidden treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/2e8620b2ffb721996e1d29264ece05ae.avif?t=1759326153\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elusive combines <strong>exploration</strong> with resource and treasure gathering, <strong>crafting</strong>, and <strong>quests\u00a0</strong>in a giant house interconnected by tunnels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE EVERY CORNER OF A HUGE HOUSE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/a4ada00fbcbe39d49c2d096b1efb7746.avif?t=1759326153\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All levels are interconnected by tunnels, and exploration blends 3D environments with 2D paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRAFT YOUR GEAR AND ENHANCE YOUR ACROBATIC SKILLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/d753a14ffd8e141cb164fddc52ae35d9.avif?t=1759326153\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire boots for special jumps, a grappling hook to reach distant places, or the moth dust dash for swift movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HIDE AND ESCAPE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/c470b1339f71be099b89a3f153e6fe9d.avif?t=1759326153\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colossal animals like the Witch's Cat and the Raven are lurking around the house. Hide from them or\u00a0they will eat you up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD A NEW ELUSIVE COMMUNITY</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/7cbcd4f74e4b7e1360adf94570081380.avif?t=1759326153\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather together all kinds of materials and treasures, and help thriving a new Elusive community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3519500?t=1759326153","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3519500?t=1759326153","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/5551f0644df90bba548bcefe8450fe0630d20965/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759326153","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/5551f0644df90bba548bcefe8450fe0630d20965/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759326153","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Elusives are <strong>tiny creatures</strong> that inhabit our homes, hiding from us and borrowing whatever they need. Humans are so big and clumsy that they do not perceive the <strong>world full of adventure and resources</strong> that extends before their feet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/9e738f7df4ca4b9f6c371ae630498794.avif?t=1759326153\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elusive raiders venture into homes to find precious resources to <strong>help the community thrive</strong>, but they\u2019re also  the most careful not to be captured by animals and other <i>huge</i> creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll <strong>explore every corner</strong> of an old haunted house, uncovering new pathways and tunnels within the walls that will lead you to hidden treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/2e8620b2ffb721996e1d29264ece05ae.avif?t=1759326153\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elusive combines <strong>exploration</strong> with resource and treasure gathering, <strong>crafting</strong>, and <strong>quests\u00a0</strong>in a giant house interconnected by tunnels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE EVERY CORNER OF A HUGE HOUSE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/a4ada00fbcbe39d49c2d096b1efb7746.avif?t=1759326153\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All levels are interconnected by tunnels, and exploration blends 3D environments with 2D paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRAFT YOUR GEAR AND ENHANCE YOUR ACROBATIC SKILLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/d753a14ffd8e141cb164fddc52ae35d9.avif?t=1759326153\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire boots for special jumps, a grappling hook to reach distant places, or the moth dust dash for swift movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HIDE AND ESCAPE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/c470b1339f71be099b89a3f153e6fe9d.avif?t=1759326153\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colossal animals like the Witch's Cat and the Raven are lurking around the house. Hide from them or\u00a0they will eat you up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD A NEW ELUSIVE COMMUNITY</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/7cbcd4f74e4b7e1360adf94570081380.avif?t=1759326153\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather together all kinds of materials and treasures, and help thriving a new Elusive community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Chibig"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/b5c74e875a4946b9a01c8045d166c5bd4097198b/header.jpg?t=1759326153","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3519500/824685/9915a5eb33620cc911afa1ee2f34d692e34ad25f/1750858566/dash_av1.mpd?t=1741189931","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3519500/824685/9915a5eb33620cc911afa1ee2f34d692e34ad25f/1750858566/dash_h264.mpd?t=1741189931","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3519500/824685/9915a5eb33620cc911afa1ee2f34d692e34ad25f/1750858566/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1741189931","id":257095638,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095638/movie480.mp4?t=1741189931","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095638/movie_max.mp4?t=1741189931"},"name":"Elusive - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257095638/131570db612599eec7b30a382679ebf040a16ef5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741189931","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095638/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741189931","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095638/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741189931"}}],"name":"Elusive","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong